<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Caregiver Wellness Passport — Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'wellness-passport' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="wp-hero" aria-labelledby="wpHeroTitle">
  <div class="container wp-hero-grid">
    <div class="wp-hero-text">
      <h1 id="wpHeroTitle">Caregiver Wellness Passport</h1>
      <p class="wp-hero-sub">Your Wellness. Your Journey. Your Pace.</p>
      <p>When you’re caring for someone else, your own needs can easily take a back seat. Between daily responsibilities, appointments, and everything else that comes with caregiving, finding time for yourself isn’t always easy.</p>
      <p>The Caregiver Wellness Passport was created to encourage family caregivers to make their own well-being a priority.</p>
      <p>Through everyday wellness activities, Legacy programs, and community experiences, caregivers can explore different areas of wellness, earn points, and work toward meaningful milestones and rewards.</p>
      <p class="wp-hero-close">Because taking care of yourself matters, too.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-coral" data-action="open-membership">Start Your Wellness Journey</a>
    </div>
    <div class="wp-hero-media">
      <img src="media/headers/wellness-passport-flowers.jpg" alt="A tiered stand of fresh flowers in white buckets: carnations, spray roses, daisies and snapdragons" width="960" height="1280" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wp-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="wpHowTitle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="wp-head">
      <h2 id="wpHowTitle">How the Wellness Passport Works</h2>
      <p>The Wellness Passport makes it easier to explore wellness in ways that fit your life. Whether you’re participating from home, attending a Legacy program, or enjoying an experience with one of our community partners, every step is an opportunity to invest in yourself.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="wp-steps">
      <li class="wp-step">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg></span>
        <h3><span class="wp-step-num">01</span> <span class="wp-step-sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Explore Your Wellness</h3>
        <p>Discover seven wellness pillars and choose activities that support your interests, needs, and personal goals.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-step">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.8.8-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.8l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8-4.2-4.1 5.8-.8z"/></svg></span>
        <h3><span class="wp-step-num">02</span> <span class="wp-step-sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Earn Points</h3>
        <p>Complete and log wellness activities to earn 10 points per activity. Your points add up as you continue participating.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-step">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 21V4"/><path d="M5 4h11l-2 4 2 4H5"/></svg></span>
        <h3><span class="wp-step-num">03</span> <span class="wp-step-sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Reach Milestones</h3>
        <p>Earn points across different wellness pillars to reach milestones, celebrate your progress, and unlock wellness rewards.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="wp-note">Activities can be completed independently at home, through Legacy programs, or with participating community partners. You can move through the Passport at your own pace.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wp-section wp-section-tint" id="pillars" aria-labelledby="wpPillarsTitle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="wp-head">
      <h2 id="wpPillarsTitle">Discover Your Seven Wellness Pillars</h2>
      <p>Wellness looks different for everyone. Our seven pillars encourage you to explore different ways of caring for your physical, emotional, and social well-being.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="wp-pillars">
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-connect">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/><path d="M2.5 20c0-3.3 2.5-6 5.5-6s5.5 2.7 5.5 6"/><path d="M14 14.6c.8-.4 1.6-.6 2.5-.6 2.8 0 5 2.4 5 5.5"/></svg></span>
        <h3>CONNECT</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Find your people.</em></p>
        <p>Build relationships, spend time with others, and create meaningful connections that help you feel supported.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-restore">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 14.5A8 8 0 1 1 9.5 4a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 10.5 10.5z"/></svg></span>
        <h3>RESTORE</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Make room to recharge.</em></p>
        <p>Prioritize rest, relaxation, emotional wellness, and activities that help you feel renewed.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-move">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="13.5" cy="4.5" r="1.8"/><path d="M9 21l2.5-6 3 2.5V21"/><path d="M6.5 11.5l3-3.5h4l2.5 3.5 2.5 1"/><path d="M11.5 15l1-7"/></svg></span>
        <h3>MOVE</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Move in ways that work for you.</em></p>
        <p>Support your physical wellness through movement, exercise, stretching, or activities you enjoy.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-nourish">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 21c-4.4 0-7-3.4-7-7.5S8 6 12 8c4-2 7 1.4 7 5.5S16.4 21 12 21z"/><path d="M12 8c0-2 1-3.5 3-4.5"/></svg></span>
        <h3>NOURISH</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Give your body what it needs.</em></p>
        <p>Explore nutrition, hydration, and healthy habits that support your overall well-being.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-explore">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 20.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 1 8.5-8.5c0 2.3-1.7 3.5-3.5 3.5h-1.8a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.2 2.9 1.2 1.2 0 0 1-.9 2.1z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="11" r="1"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="7.5" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="8" r="1"/></svg></span>
        <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Try something new.</em></p>
        <p>Make time for creativity, hobbies, new experiences, and activities that bring you joy.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-learn">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 5.5c3-1 6-1 9 1 3-2 6-2 9-1V19c-3-1-6-1-9 1-3-2-6-2-9-1z"/><path d="M12 6.5V20"/></svg></span>
        <h3>LEARN</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Keep discovering and growing.</em></p>
        <p>Explore new knowledge, skills, and learning opportunities that support your personal growth.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-pillar wp-pillar-prepare">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M4 10h16"/><path d="M9 15l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
        <h3>PREPARE</h3>
        <p class="wp-tagline"><em>Plan for your well-being.</em></p>
        <p>Take meaningful steps toward planning, organizing, and preparing for your personal and family needs.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wp-section" id="milestones" aria-labelledby="wpMilestonesTitle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="wp-head">
      <h2 id="wpMilestonesTitle">Your Wellness Journey, One Milestone at a Time</h2>
      <p>Every step you take toward your well-being deserves recognition.</p>
      <p>As you complete activities and earn points across the seven wellness pillars, you’ll work toward four milestones designed to celebrate your progress and encourage you to keep going.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="wp-milestones">
      <li class="wp-milestone">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 20v-6"/><path d="M12 14c0-2.5-1.8-4-4.5-4 0 2.5 1.8 4 4.5 4z"/><path d="M7 20h10"/></svg></span>
        <h3>ROOTED</h3>
        <p class="wp-points">50 Points</p>
        <p>Participate in activities across at least 3 wellness pillars.</p>
        <p class="wp-reward"><strong>Reward:</strong> Legacy Welcome Gift</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-milestone">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 20V9"/><path d="M12 14c0-2.6-2-4.2-5-4.2 0 2.6 2 4.2 5 4.2z"/><path d="M12 11c0-2.8 2-4.6 5-4.6 0 2.8-2 4.6-5 4.6z"/><path d="M7 20h10"/></svg></span>
        <h3>GROWING</h3>
        <p class="wp-points">100 Points</p>
        <p>Participate in activities across at least 4 wellness pillars.</p>
        <p class="wp-reward"><strong>Reward:</strong> Wellness Partner Reward</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-milestone">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 20V5"/><path d="M12 16c0-2.4-1.9-4-4.6-4 0 2.4 1.9 4 4.6 4z"/><path d="M12 12.5c0-2.6 2-4.2 4.8-4.2 0 2.6-2 4.2-4.8 4.2z"/><path d="M12 8.5c0-2-1.4-3.3-3.6-3.3 0 2 1.4 3.3 3.6 3.3z"/><path d="M7 20h10"/></svg></span>
        <h3>THRIVING</h3>
        <p class="wp-points">150 Points</p>
        <p>Participate in activities across at least 6 wellness pillars.</p>
        <p class="wp-reward"><strong>Reward:</strong> Premium Wellness Experience</p>
      </li>
      <li class="wp-milestone">
        <span class="wp-icon-wrap"><svg class="wp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 20V9"/><circle cx="12" cy="6" r="2"/><path d="M12 3.5v-.5M9.5 6H9M15 6h-.5M10.2 4.2l-.4-.4M14.2 4.2l.4-.4"/><path d="M12 16c0-2.6-2-4.4-5-4.4 0 2.6 2 4.4 5 4.4z"/><path d="M12 13c0-2.6 2-4.2 5-4.2 0 2.6-2 4.2-5 4.2z"/><path d="M6 20h12"/></svg></span>
        <h3>FLOURISHING</h3>
        <p class="wp-points">200 Points</p>
        <p>Participate in activities across all 7 wellness pillars.</p>
        <p class="wp-reward"><strong>Reward:</strong> Eligibility to apply for a Wellness Grant</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="wp-info">
      <p>Each completed and logged activity earns 10 points. Points are cumulative, meaning your progress continues as you reach each milestone.</p>
      <p>Wellness Grant eligibility is based on program requirements and available funding. Reaching the Flourishing milestone does not guarantee grant approval or funding.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wp-cta" id="get-started" aria-labelledby="wpCtaTitle">
  <div class="container wp-cta-inner">
    <h2 id="wpCtaTitle">It’s Time to Make Room for You</h2>
    <p>You spend so much time caring for others. Your well-being deserves that same attention.</p>
    <p>Whether you’re taking your first step toward prioritizing yourself or looking for new ways to support your wellness, the Caregiver Wellness Passport is here to encourage you along the way.</p>
    <p>Start your journey, explore what wellness means to you, and celebrate the progress you make.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-coral" data-action="open-membership">Start Your Wellness Journey</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_membership-modal.html.j2' %}
{% include '_grant-apply-modal.html.j2' %}
{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
